    <string name="about_privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_text">All your data — settings, marks and statistics — is stored only on this phone. The internet is used only to load prayer times from aladhan.com.</string>
    <string name="about_times_title">Prayer times</string>
    <string name="about_times_text">Times come from aladhan.com or are calculated on the phone with the same astronomical formulas. A mosque\'s schedule may differ by a few minutes — use corrections in the settings.</string>
    <string name="about_quiz_title">Questions</string>
    <string name="about_quiz_text">The questions cover well-established facts about the Quran, the prophets, the Seerah and the basics of Islam. They are not a fatwa: for religious rulings, consult a qualified scholar.</string>
